message: "If you use ARIA-X in academic or technical work, please cite this repository."
title: "ARIA-X"
abstract: >-
  ARIA-X is a local-first state-space reasoning engine for security research.
  It combines a blackboard search model, a planner/worker graph architecture
  and specialist delegation in one standard-library-only Python implementation.
